<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰρύαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>, αἱ, <u>Caryae</u>, a
		place in Laconia with a famous temple of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
			Th.
			5.55
		</span></i>, etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰρῠᾶτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, μέλισσα</span>
		(prob. priestess of Artemis) <i><span class="en">
			St.Byz.
		</span></i>; as Subst. esp. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<u>Artemis</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				3.10.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dance in honour of Artemis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.104
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρυατίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰρῠάτῐδες</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, αἱ,
				<i>priestesses of Artemis at Caryae</i>, Pratin.Lyr.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Archit.,
				<i>female figures used as bearing-shafts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lync.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.241e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				1.1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a kind of
				<i>ear-rings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.97
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
